At the design stage, check L1 and L2 and keep required L3 trials pending. Before the dependent actual task, obtain the evidence and effective confirmation specified in advance. Keep the required evidence level after a failed check.

## 3. Controlled trial categories

ST01–ST12 are trial design categories. Bind actual project trials to object version, platform, synthetic data, authorization, assertions, and evidence. Record justified capability exclusions. Keep an applicable trial unverified when the environment is unavailable.

